Package: HydroTomo
Title: Hydraulic Tomographic Pumping Test
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Yuanyuan", "Zha", , "zhayuan87@whu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
  This packages simulates the groundwater heads induced by pumping tests, and use inverse method to invert
  the hydraulic parameters distribution so as to improve the future prediction.
